{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Iagosh_01_cv_text", "source": "It was all... so close....", "translation": "Wszystko było... tak blisko....", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Iagosh_02_cv_text", "source": "Ishtar...", "translation": "Ishtar...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_01_cv_text", "source": "... I have dreamed a very long dream.", "translation": "...Śniłem bardzo długo.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_02_cv_text", "source": "Within the darkness, Ishtar kept me imprisoned.", "translation": "W ciemności Ishtar więził mnie przez cały ten czas.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_03_cv_text", "source": "The Core...?", "translation": "Rdzeń...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_04_cv_text", "source": "That is so. Even now, my life is trickling away.", "translation": "Zgadza się. Nawet teraz uchodzi ze mnie życie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_05_cv_text", "source": "Ishtar will be greatly harmed if I perish before her recovery is complete.", "translation": "Jeśli umrę, zanim Ishtar w pełni odzyska siły, bardzo ją skrzywdzę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_06_cv_text", "source": "Now I shall begin to fade away.", "translation": "Zaraz zacznę znikać.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_07_cv_text", "source": "Not by force, but by choice.", "translation": "Nie z przymusu, lecz z własnej woli.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_08_cv_text", "source": "Take the Core with you, and go.", "translation": "Weź ze sobą Rdzeń i odejdź.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_09_cv_text", "source": "You have made it this far, which is more than enough.", "translation": "Dotarcie aż tutaj w zupełności wystarczy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_10_cv_text", "source": "Sacrifice is a seed...", "translation": "Poświęcenie to ziarno...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_Yustiel_11_cv_text", "source": "... from which hope shall sprout and grow.", "translation": "...z którego wykiełkuje i wyrośnie nadzieja.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_kalid_01_cv_text", "source": "You are now free, Empyrean Lord Yustiel.", "translation": "Jesteś teraz wolna, Władczyni Empirian Yustiel.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_pernos_01_cv_text", "source": "O Yustiel, we have come to ask for the Core of Life.", "translation": "O Yustiel, przybyliśmy prosić o Rdzeń Życia.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_pernos_02_cv_text", "source": "You would give us the Core without any trials?", "translation": "Oddasz nam Rdzeń bez żadnych prób?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_pernos_03_cv_text", "source": "The time has come.", "translation": "Nadeszła pora.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1441_pernos_04_cv_text", "source": "Elysium is our next stop...", "translation": "Następny przystanek: Elysium...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1450_Kalid_01_cv_text", "source": "Phernos? Phernos!", "translation": "Phernos? Phernos!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Kalid_01_cv_text", "source": "Is that...?", "translation": "Czy to...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Kalid_02_cv_text", "source": "Captain! No!", "translation": "Kapitanie! Nie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Nania_01_cv_text", "source": "Phernos!", "translation": "Phernos!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Nania_02_cv_text", "source": "... Nania!", "translation": "...Naniu!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Pernos_01_cv_text", "source": "Elysea will be whole once again.", "translation": "Elysea znów będzie całością.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S1451_Pernos_02_cv_text", "source": "We must remember their efforts.", "translation": "Musimy pamiętać o ich poświęceniu.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Stop!", "translation": "Stój!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "This is my guest.", "translation": "To mój gość.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Now get back to work.", "translation": "A teraz wracaj do pracy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Well? You got something to say?", "translation": "No? Masz coś do powiedzenia?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "This place isn't exactly welcoming to outsiders.", "translation": "To miejsce niezbyt gościnnie wita obcych.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_Nemon_06_cv_text", "source": "You arrived sooner than expected.", "translation": "Przybywasz wcześniej, niż się spodziewałem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_People_01_cv_text", "source": "Who are you? What're you doing here?", "translation": "Kim jesteś? Co tu robisz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2010_People_02_cv_text", "source": "Nemon!", "translation": "Nemon!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Hadal_01_cv_text", "source": "Nemon...", "translation": "Nemon...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Hadal_02_cv_text", "source": "Is it safe to bring in an outsider like this?", "translation": "Czy sprowadzenie tu obcej osoby jest bezpieczne?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Planning to stare 'em to death?", "translation": "Chcesz ich zabić samym spojrzeniem?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "This \"outsider\" is an important witness.", "translation": "Ten „obcy” jest ważnym świadkiem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "So you'd better be polite.", "translation": "Lepiej więc okaż mu szacunek.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "It might be.", "translation": "Możliwe.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Now, shall we talk?", "translation": "Może porozmawiamy?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Sounds like a threat.", "translation": "Brzmi jak groźba.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2011_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Hmph.", "translation": "Hmph.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2012_Ashar_01_cv_text", "source": "Come... Come to me...", "translation": "Chodź... Chodź do mnie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_01_cv_text", "source": "Ahhhh!", "translation": "Aaa!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_02_cv_text", "source": "Hnnnh!", "translation": "Hnnnh!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_03_cv_text", "source": "Ahhhhh!", "translation": "Aaaa!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_04_cv_text", "source": "Spare me! I beg you!", "translation": "Oszczędź mnie! Błagam!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_05_cv_text", "source": "I'll give you everything I own! Please!", "translation": "Oddam ci wszystko, co mam! Proszę!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_06_cv_text", "source": "Just spare my life!", "translation": "Tylko daruj mi życie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_07_cv_text", "source": "Y-Yes! The one and only! I'll tell you anything you want to know!", "translation": "T-Tak! To ja, nikt inny! Powiem ci wszystko, co chcesz wiedzieć!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_08_cv_text", "source": "Any may enter here freely.", "translation": "Każdy może tu swobodnie wejść.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_09_cv_text", "source": "But leaving is a different matter.", "translation": "Ale wyjście to już inna sprawa.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_10_cv_text", "source": "Fret not, however!", "translation": "Nie martw się jednak!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_11_cv_text", "source": "We can escape through the tunnels made by the Karas.", "translation": "Uciekniemy tunelami wykopanymi przez Karasów.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Brok_12_cv_text", "source": "I-I can lead the way! As long as you promise to keep me safe!", "translation": "M-Mogę poprowadzić! Tylko obiecaj, że nic mi się nie stanie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "This...", "translation": "To...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "...is a cursed place.", "translation": "...przeklęte miejsce.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "Countless people died here. Mutated...", "translation": "Zginęły tu niezliczone osoby. Zmutowane...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "Buried alive.", "translation": "Pogrzebane żywcem.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_05_cv_text", "source": "Even the gravekeepers don't dare to enter.", "translation": "Nawet grabarze nie mają odwagi tu wejść.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_06_cv_text", "source": "So pay attention. This is tainted soil.", "translation": "Uważaj więc. Ta ziemia jest skażona.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_07_cv_text", "source": "Must be the owner of the tomb.", "translation": "To chyba właściciel grobowca.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_08_cv_text", "source": "Who the hell are you?", "translation": "Kim do cholery jesteś?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_09_cv_text", "source": "Are you that Brok I've been hearing about?", "translation": "To ty jesteś tym Brokiem, o którym tyle słyszę?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_10_cv_text", "source": "Not here.", "translation": "Nie tutaj.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_11_cv_text", "source": "I'll take you to Nemon first.", "translation": "Najpierw zaprowadzę cię do Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_12_cv_text", "source": "Damn it! What now...?", "translation": "Cholera! Co teraz...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2020_Ulgorn_13_cv_text", "source": "Karas? No thanks.", "translation": "Karas? Nie, dziękuję.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2021_Brok_02_cv_text", "source": "Th-This is m... miasma!", "translation": "T-To m... miazma!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Brok_01_cv_text", "source": "Eek! What's going on?", "translation": "Eee! Co się dzieje?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Brok_02_cv_text", "source": "There's no time. Hurry!", "translation": "Nie ma czasu. Szybko!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Brok_03_cv_text", "source": "This way!", "translation": "Tędy!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Ugh... What happened?", "translation": "Ugh... Co się stało?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Where's the monster?", "translation": "Gdzie jest potwór?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "Did you kill it?", "translation": "Udało ci się go zabić?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2022_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "Impressive. You've exceeded my expectations.", "translation": "Imponujące. Przekraczasz moje oczekiwania.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Brok_01_cv_text", "source": "Don't worry, it's just a dead Karas.", "translation": "Spokojnie, to tylko martwy Karas.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Brok_02_cv_text", "source": "I'm certain the Karas dug an escape tunnel.", "translation": "Jestem pewien, że Karas wykopał tunel ucieczkowy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Brok_03_cv_text", "source": "It's definitely in here...", "translation": "Na pewno jest gdzieś tutaj...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Brok_04_cv_text", "source": "Eek! That K-Karas is still alive!", "translation": "Eee! T-Ten Karas wciąż żyje!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_01_cv_text", "source": "Gis...elle...?", "translation": "Gis...elle...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_02_cv_text", "source": "Giselle... My love...", "translation": "Giselle... Moja ukochana...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_03_cv_text", "source": "Why...", "translation": "Dlaczego...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_04_cv_text", "source": "Why...did you take her?", "translation": "Dlaczego... ją zabrano?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_05_cv_text", "source": "Give her back...", "translation": "Oddaj ją...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Hiladr_06_cv_text", "source": "Gis-elle!", "translation": "Gis-elle!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "What the hell is that?", "translation": "Co to do cholery jest?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Are we going the right way?", "translation": "Idziemy w dobrą stronę?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "Is there really a path out?", "translation": "Naprawdę jest stąd jakieś wyjście?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2023_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "So where is it exactly?", "translation": "Gdzie dokładnie ono jest?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Brok_01_cv_text", "source": "Hngh!", "translation": "Hngh!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Brok_02_cv_text", "source": "Eek!", "translation": "Eee!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Hiladr_01_cv_text", "source": "Giselle... is not... a Karas...", "translation": "Giselle... nie jest... Karasem...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Hiladr_02_cv_text", "source": "Giselle...", "translation": "Giselle...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Is THAT your tunnel?", "translation": "To ma być ten wasz tunel?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "The monster's forgotten we're here.", "translation": "Potwór zapomniał, że tu jesteśmy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "Now is our chance...", "translation": "Teraz nasza szansa...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "That bastard!", "translation": "Ty draniu!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2024_Ulgorn_05_cv_text", "source": "Run!", "translation": "Biegnij!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2025_Asar_01_cv_text", "source": "My fragment, my shadow...", "translation": "Mój fragment, mój cień...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2025_Asar_02_cv_text", "source": "Come to me...", "translation": "Chodź do mnie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2025_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Here! Over here!", "translation": "Tutaj! Tędy!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2026_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "You're awake? Come this way.", "translation": "Już nie śpisz? Chodź tędy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2031_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "...Incredible!", "translation": "...Niesamowite!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2040_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "An Empyrean Lord's sanctum...", "translation": "Sanktuarium Władcy Empirian...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2040_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Now little more than a wraith-infested den.", "translation": "Teraz to już tylko siedlisko widm.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2040_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "That's...", "translation": "To...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2040_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "Brok...", "translation": "Brok...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2041_Nua_01_cv_text", "source": "Hm, uninvited pests.", "translation": "Hm, nieproszone szkodniki.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2041_Nua_02_cv_text", "source": "...Where is the traitor Nemon?", "translation": "...Gdzie jest zdrajczyni Nemon?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2041_Nua_03_cv_text", "source": "Has your master let you off your leash, Ulgorn?", "translation": "Twój pan spuścił cię ze smyczy, Ulgorn?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2041_Nua_04_cv_text", "source": "Blame Nemon.", "translation": "Wszystko przez Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Filthy rats feasting upon the Balaur's leftovers...", "translation": "Parszywe szczury żerujące na resztkach po Balaurach...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Worthless fools.", "translation": "Bezwartościowi głupcy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "There were corpses strung up on display.", "translation": "Zwłoki wisiały na widoku.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "It was the Blades all along...", "translation": "To jednak Ostrza za tym stały...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "Come on.", "translation": "Chodźmy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nua_01_cv_text", "source": "Filthy vermin!", "translation": "Parszywe robactwo!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nua_02_cv_text", "source": "I will exterminate you!", "translation": "Wytępię was!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nua_03_cv_text", "source": "Arghhh!!", "translation": "Aaaa!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nua_04_cv_text", "source": "Damn you, Nemon!", "translation": "Przeklęta Nemon!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Nua_05_cv_text", "source": "I will kill you!", "translation": "Zabiję cię!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "Urgh...", "translation": "Urgh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2042_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "Go. Find the Fafnite.", "translation": "Idź. Znajdź Fafnita.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Where is the high priest's Fafnite?", "translation": "Gdzie jest Fafnit Najwyższego Kapłana?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_01_cv_text", "source": "Urk...", "translation": "Urk...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_02_cv_text", "source": "L-Losing to the likes of you...", "translation": "P-Przegrać z takimi jak wy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_03_cv_text", "source": "Captain Gerod...", "translation": "Kapitan Gerod...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_04_cv_text", "source": "...will be waiting for you...", "translation": "...będzie na was czekać...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_05_cv_text", "source": "Whatever you do, we...", "translation": "Cokolwiek zrobicie, my...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2044_Tasin_06_cv_text", "source": "...know what you're up to... Nemon...", "translation": "...wiemy, co knujesz... Nemon...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Kraki_01_cv_text", "source": "Please...", "translation": "Proszę...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "That's Kraki on the altar.", "translation": "To Kraki na ołtarzu.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Tassin! Let him go!", "translation": "Tassin! Puść go!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "I said, let him go right now Tassin.", "translation": "Mówię: puść go natychmiast, Tassin!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "Tassin! Enough of your nonsense...", "translation": "Tassin! Dość tych bzdur...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "You've always been rotten.", "translation": "Od zawsze masz podły charakter.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Nemon_06_cv_text", "source": "Is that a threat?", "translation": "Czy to groźba?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_01_cv_text", "source": "You finally came!", "translation": "Wreszcie przybyłaś!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_02_cv_text", "source": "Lady of Bellusran...", "translation": "Pani Bellusran...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_03_cv_text", "source": "We are humbled by your presence.", "translation": "Jesteśmy zaszczyceni twoją obecnością.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_04_cv_text", "source": "Are you pleased to see me?", "translation": "Cieszysz się, że mnie widzisz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_05_cv_text", "source": "My, oh my!", "translation": "No, no!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_06_cv_text", "source": "I fear your temper...", "translation": "Obawiam się, że twój temperament...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_07_cv_text", "source": "...has only grown shorter.", "translation": "...stał się jeszcze bardziej wybuchowy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_08_cv_text", "source": "May I remind you, speak only when spoken to", "translation": "Przypominam: odzywaj się tylko, gdy ktoś cię o to poprosi.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_09_cv_text", "source": "Nemon.", "translation": "Rozumiesz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_10_cv_text", "source": "You never did listen...", "translation": "Nigdy nie słuchałaś...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_11_cv_text", "source": "Do you only listen to fellow traitors, is that it?", "translation": "Słuchasz tylko innych zdrajców, tak?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_12_cv_text", "source": "Haha, I believe our noble lady has a question.", "translation": "Haha, nasza szlachetna pani ma chyba pytanie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_13_cv_text", "source": "So, tell her. Tell her, traitor.", "translation": "No, powiedz jej. Powiedz, zdrajco.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_14_cv_text", "source": "Where may she find", "translation": "Gdzie można znaleźć", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_15_cv_text", "source": "the high priest's Fafnite?", "translation": "Fafnita Najwyższego Kapłana?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_16_cv_text", "source": "I told you to keep your mouth shut!", "translation": "Kazałam ci trzymać język za zębami!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_17_cv_text", "source": "Heh heh heh...", "translation": "He, he, he...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_18_cv_text", "source": "Now how will you find it?", "translation": "I jak teraz go znajdziesz?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_19_cv_text", "source": "My lady.", "translation": "Moja pani.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_20_cv_text", "source": "Persisting on this path,", "translation": "Podążanie tą drogą", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_21_cv_text", "source": "will only bring down more suffering.", "translation": "przyniesie tylko więcej cierpienia.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2045_Tasion_23_cv_text", "source": "It's a fact.", "translation": "To fakt.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_01_cv_text", "source": "Hmph, of course...", "translation": "Hmph, oczywiście...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_02_cv_text", "source": "It was Nemon's lackey.", "translation": "To był sługus Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_03_cv_text", "source": "Ngh, I don't talk to traitors...", "translation": "Ngh, nie rozmawiam ze zdrajcami...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_04_cv_text", "source": "You fed well, didn't you, parasite?", "translation": "Nieźle się nażarto, co, pasożycie?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_05_cv_text", "source": "I-I don't know...", "translation": "N-Nie wiem...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_06_cv_text", "source": "W-Wait!", "translation": "C-Czekaj!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Captive_07_cv_text", "source": "I-It's in Ishalgen!", "translation": "J-Jest w Ishalgen!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Ulgorn_01_cv_text", "source": "The Blood Blades Insignia...", "translation": "Insygnia Krwawych Ostrzy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Ulgorn_02_cv_text", "source": "That settles it.", "translation": "To przesądza sprawę.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Ulgorn_03_cv_text", "source": "What are you planning? Are these Gerod's orders?", "translation": "Co planujesz? To rozkazy Geroda?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Ulgorn_04_cv_text", "source": "What did you do with the Fafnite?", "translation": "Co zrobiono z Fafnitem?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2050_Ulgorn_05_cv_text", "source": "Not so taciturn now, are you?", "translation": "Nie jesteś już taki małomówny, co?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Elim01_01_cv_text", "source": "Leave now, shall we...?", "translation": "Może już pójdziemy...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Elim01_02_cv_text", "source": "Promise...!", "translation": "Obiecaj...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Elim02_01_cv_text", "source": "Troublesome, if scary person.", "translation": "Kłopotliwa osoba, choć budzi strach.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "The Blades...", "translation": "Ostrza...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Are we too late?", "translation": "Czy jest już za późno?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Who's there?", "translation": "Kto tam?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "It's okay, I'm a friend of Nornir.", "translation": "Spokojnie, jestem przyjacielem Nornir.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_05_cv_text", "source": "I won't hurt you.", "translation": "Nie zrobię ci krzywdy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2070_Nemon_06_cv_text", "source": "I promise.", "translation": "Obiecuję.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2071_Gartua_01_cv_text", "source": "All spirits shall heed Etheria's summons.", "translation": "Wszystkie duchy odpowiedzą na wezwanie Etherii.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2071_Gartua_02_cv_text", "source": "Whether by choice, or by force.", "translation": "Dobrowolnie lub siłą.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2071_Gartua_03_cv_text", "source": "Even if you are reduced to dust, it is of no matter to me.", "translation": "Nawet jeśli obrócisz się w proch, nie będzie mnie to obchodzić.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2072_Eco_01_cv_text", "source": "Thank you. I didn't want to go to Etheria.", "translation": "Dziękuję. Nie chciałem iść do Etherii.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2072_Eco_02_cv_text", "source": "The rift will reopen eventually...", "translation": "Szczelina w końcu znów się otworzy...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2072_Eco_03_cv_text", "source": "But it should be fine for now.", "translation": "Ale na razie powinno być dobrze.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2072_Eco_04_cv_text", "source": "Odar? You wish to awaken an Elim?", "translation": "Odar? Chcesz przebudzić Elima?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2072_Eco_05_cv_text", "source": "I can help with that.", "translation": "Mogę w tym pomóc.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2073_Eco_01_cv_text", "source": "Odar. A friend of Nornir has come.", "translation": "Odarze, przybył przyjaciel Nornir.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2073_Odar_01_cv_text", "source": "Haaaaaah...", "translation": "Haaaaaah...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2073_Odar_02_cv_text", "source": "Another... Daeva...", "translation": "Kolejny... Daev...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Unbelievable...", "translation": "Nie do wiary...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "These petrification traps are Nornir-made, but who used this on them?", "translation": "Te pułapki skamieniające zrobiły Nornir, ale kto użył ich na tych osobach?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Who is...?", "translation": "Kto...?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Nemon_04_cv_text", "source": "What happened here?", "translation": "Co tu się stało?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Reichen_01_cv_text", "source": "Ugh...", "translation": "Ugh...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Reichen_02_cv_text", "source": "Lady Nemon...", "translation": "Pani Nemon...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Reichen_03_cv_text", "source": "The Blades... petrification traps...", "translation": "Ostrza... pułapki skamieniające...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2080_Reichen_04_cv_text", "source": "Be careful...", "translation": "Uważaj...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2081_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Damn it...", "translation": "Cholera...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2081_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "The Fafnium's already absorbed their souls.", "translation": "Fafnium już wchłonęło ich dusze.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_01_cv_text", "source": "Took you long enough, Nemon.", "translation": "Długo kazałaś na siebie czekać, Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_02_cv_text", "source": "You are violent, Lady of Bellusran.", "translation": "Jesteś gwałtowna, Pani Bellusran.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_03_cv_text", "source": "They say a god hid a curse within women to bring about the fall of men.", "translation": "Mówią, że bóg ukrył w kobietach klątwę, by doprowadzić do upadku mężczyzn.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_04_cv_text", "source": "Your sin is that of deception.", "translation": "Twoim grzechem jest oszustwo.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_05_cv_text", "source": "You will pay for deceiving me...", "translation": "Zapłacisz za to, że mnie oszukałaś...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_06_cv_text", "source": "...with the lives of those around you.", "translation": "...życiem tych, którzy cię otaczają.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_07_cv_text", "source": "Beg for mercy. Return to us, Nemon.", "translation": "Błagaj o litość. Wróć do nas, Nemon.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Gerod_08_cv_text", "source": "And those around you shall die for it.", "translation": "Inaczej zginą ci, którzy są przy tobie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Gerod...", "translation": "Gerod...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "It'd be best to stop here.", "translation": "Lepiej tu skończmy.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2083_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "Shut up.", "translation": "Zamknij się.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2084_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Are you okay?", "translation": "Wszystko w porządku?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2084_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Everyone, this way!", "translation": "Wszyscy tędy!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2084_Tormund_01_cv_text", "source": "Hallina... Urd...", "translation": "Hallina... Urd...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2084_Tormund_02_cv_text", "source": "must... to the Assembly...", "translation": "muszę... do Zgromadzenia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2090_Griscilla_01_cv_text", "source": "Shall we enter then?", "translation": "Wchodzimy?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2091_Griscilla_01_cv_text", "source": "The corrosion has intensified.", "translation": "Korozja się nasiliła.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2091_Griscilla_04_cv_text", "source": "It is imperative it must be purified before it is too late.", "translation": "Trzeba to oczyścić, zanim będzie za późno.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2092_Griscilla_01_cv_text", "source": "The purifying light...", "translation": "Światło oczyszczające...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2092_Griscilla_02_cv_text", "source": "The sacred tree is finally...", "translation": "Święte drzewo wreszcie...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2092_Griscilla_03_cv_text", "source": "It can't be! Fafnir's poison blood...!", "translation": "To niemożliwe! Zatruta krew Fafnira...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_01_cv_text", "source": "Please... This time...", "translation": "Proszę... Tym razem...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_02_cv_text", "source": "Ah...!", "translation": "Ach...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_03_cv_text", "source": "Thank you, Daeva.", "translation": "Dziękuję, Daevie.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_04_cv_text", "source": "This life essence...", "translation": "Ta esencja życia...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_05_cv_text", "source": "...is my repayment.", "translation": "...to moja zapłata.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_06_cv_text", "source": "It will be of great help to you someday.", "translation": "Kiedyś bardzo ci się przyda.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_07_cv_text", "source": "I shall return to the sacred tree now.", "translation": "Wrócę teraz do świętego drzewa.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2093_Griscilla_08_cv_text", "source": "Farewell...", "translation": "Żegnaj...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2100_Histan_01_cv_text", "source": "Lord Zikel...!", "translation": "Władco Zikel...!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2100_Histan_02_cv_text", "source": "I have... failed you...", "translation": "Zawiodłem cię...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_01_cv_text", "source": "You...", "translation": "Ty...", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_02_cv_text", "source": "You must honor the Blood Oath!", "translation": "Musisz dochować Krwawej Przysięgi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_03_cv_text", "source": "..Ugh!", "translation": "...Ugh!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_04_cv_text", "source": "Destruction Archons! Lay down your lives!", "translation": "Archonci Zniszczenia! Oddajcie życie!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_05_cv_text", "source": "Reuben! Stand your ground!", "translation": "Reuben! Nie ustępuj!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_06_cv_text", "source": "We must honor... the Blood Oath!", "translation": "Musimy dochować... Krwawej Przysięgi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_07_cv_text", "source": "You are merely the residue of the true Zikel. There is no eternal rest for you.", "translation": "Jesteś jedynie pozostałością po prawdziwym Zikelu. Nie zaznasz wiecznego spoczynku.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_08_cv_text", "source": "Indnath, you bastard!", "translation": "Indnath, ty draniu!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Histan_09_cv_text", "source": "No, I'm... I'm not a monster!", "translation": "Nie jestem potworem!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Urd_01_cv_text", "source": "Hystan, high priest of Zikel.", "translation": "Hystan, Najwyższy Kapłan Zikela.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Urd_02_cv_text", "source": "Leader of the Destruction Archons.", "translation": "Przywódca Archontów Zniszczenia.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2101_Urd_03_cv_text", "source": "Reveal the past.", "translation": "Ukaż przeszłość.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2140_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "We're too late.", "translation": "Jest już za późno.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2140_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Hurry, before we lose the last Destruction Archon.", "translation": "Pospiesz się, zanim stracimy ostatniego Archonta Zniszczenia.", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Nemon_01_cv_text", "source": "Are you a Destruction Archon?", "translation": "Czy jesteś Archontem Zniszczenia?", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Nemon_02_cv_text", "source": "Answer me!", "translation": "Odpowiedz mi!", "status": "draft"}
{"id": "CutsceneSubtitle_S2143_Nemon_03_cv_text", "source": "We're almost out of time!", "translation": "Kończy nam się czas!", "status": "draft"}
